 "scratch": "设计情境：自驾去古城。速度125千米/时，时间14小时。估算：125≈130, 14≈10 -> 1300; 或 125*10=1250, 125*4=500, 总和1750。精确计算：125×14。125×4=500, 125×10=1250, 500+1250=1750。目的地距离1800千米。1750 < 1800，不够。还差 1800-1750=50千米。",
 "solver_code": "from decimal import Decimal\n\ndef solve():\n    speed = 125\n    time = 14\n    distance_goal = 1800\n    \n    # Calculate actual distance\n    actual_distance = speed * time\n    \n    # Check if enough\n    is_enough = actual_distance >= distance_goal\n    \n    # Calculate difference if not enough, or excess if enough\n    if not is_enough:\n        diff = distance_goal - actual_distance\n    else:\n        diff = actual_distance - distance_goal\n        \n    return [\"不够\", str(diff)]",
 "stem": "爸爸开车带全家去古城旅游，汽车平均每小时行驶 $125$ 千米，预计行驶 $14$ 小时到达。已知古城距离出发地 $1800$ 千米。\n\n（1）按这个速度和时间行驶，能到达古城吗？\n（2）如果不能到达，还差多少千米？如果能到达，超出多少千米？",
 "options": [],
